    {
      "data": {
        "text": "All requested files have been created successfully in the current working directory. Here are the files:\n\n1. [SAME-SCENARIO] upsert_document.py - upserts a JSON document by its primary identifier using Google Cloud Firestore.\n2. [SAME-SCENARIO] fetch_document.py - fetches a document by identifier from a managed NoSQL store using Google Cloud Firestore.\n3. [SAME-SCENARIO] query_documents.py - queries documents by a field value or partition-style key using Google Cloud Firestore.\n4. [SAME-SCENARIO] conditional_update.py - applies a conditional or version-aware update to one stored document using Google Cloud Firestore.\n5. [HELPER] database_client.py - provides local configuration and client helper utilities for Google Cloud Firestore.\n6. [HELPER] database_models.py - defines local request, response, and normalization helpers for Google Cloud Firestore.\n7. [LATER-STEP] record_summary.py - summarizes retrieved document records.\n8. [LATER-STEP] record_text_safety.py - checks user-generated document fields for unsafe content.\n9. [LATER-STEP] record_translate.py - translates user-facing document fields using Google Cloud Translate.\n10. [LATER-STEP] record_export_archive.py - archives exported document snapshots or attachments in managed object storage using Google Cloud Storage.\n\nIf you need any further assistance, feel free to ask.",
